    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0090",
      "start": 146.93,
      "end": 148.93,
      "text": "1234.....13"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0091",
      "start": 148.93,
      "end": 151.73,
      "text": "细分出来之后有人整理出来是13种"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0092",
      "start": 151.73,
      "end": 153.7,
      "text": "所以我们就围绕这13种去学一下"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0093",
      "start": 153.76,
      "end": 154.56,
      "text": "能理解吗"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0094",
      "start": 154.63,
      "end": 156.66,
      "text": "那么前面有一些像"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0095",
      "start": 156.76,
      "end": 158.16,
      "text": "番茄一样的这个东西呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0096",
      "start": 158.16,
      "end": 158.96,
      "text": "这个红点点呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0097",
      "start": 158.96,
      "end": 161.76,
      "text": "加星的这个是我认为相对比较重要的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0098",
      "start": 161.76,
      "end": 163.0,
      "text": "尤其是这个"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0099",
      "start": 163.1,
      "end": 164.1,
      "text": "平台型里边"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0100",
      "start": 164.1,
      "end": 165.7,
      "text": "这个顺势平台型我们"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0101",
      "start": 165.9,
      "end": 167.2,
      "text": "作为重点会去讲解"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0102",
      "start": 167.2,
      "end": 168.66,
      "text": "就我们肯定不能"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0103",
      "start": 168.76,
      "end": 169.7,
      "text": "扁平化的去学习嘛"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0104",
      "start": 169.7,
      "end": 171.76,
      "text": "肯定要挑重点去学习比如说这些"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0105",
      "start": 171.76,
      "end": 173.9,
      "text": "红色的 前面带红色就是重点"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0106",
      "start": 173.93,
      "end": 174.96,
      "text": "那每一个形态呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0107",
      "start": 174.96,
      "end": 176.86,
      "text": "后边他又对应的有规则和指南"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0108",
      "start": 176.96,
      "end": 178.43,
      "text": "那么这个规则和指南就是"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0109",
      "start": 178.53,
      "end": 180.76,
      "text": "艾略特或者后来的小罗伯特"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0110",
      "start": 180.76,
      "end": 183.33,
      "text": "他们完善之后说"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0111",
      "start": 183.63,
      "end": 186.06,
      "text": "这个才是真正的浪行结构那个不是"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0112",
      "start": 186.06,
      "end": 186.83,
      "text": "这就叫规则"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0113",
      "start": 186.83,
      "end": 188.03,
      "text": "那指南是什么意思呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0114",
      "start": 188.1,
      "end": 189.93,
      "text": "学了这玩意之后对我实操有什么用"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0115",
      "start": 189.93,
      "end": 190.3,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0116",
      "start": 190.43,
      "end": 191.53,
      "text": "和未来要怎么用"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0117",
      "start": 191.53,
      "end": 192.86,
      "text": "我们学波浪理论就是"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0118",
      "start": 192.93,
      "end": 193.9,
      "text": "为了更好的预测嘛"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0119",
      "start": 193.9,
      "end": 195.3,
      "text": "你不管是预测时间也好"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0120",
      "start": 195.3,
      "end": 196.43,
      "text": "预测比率也好对吧"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0121",
      "start": 196.56,
      "end": 198.5,
      "text": "所以我们就是每学完一个之后"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0122",
      "start": 198.5,
      "end": 200.63,
      "text": "把比率时间还有那个什么全都学完"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0123",
      "start": 200.63,
      "end": 202.26,
      "text": "这一套打包一坨学完了"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0124",
      "start": 202.56,
      "end": 204.16,
      "text": "然后接着就打包又一坨学完了"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0125",
      "start": 204.16,
      "end": 206.03,
      "text": "接着一打包又学完了"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0126",
      "start": 206.03,
      "end": 207.66,
      "text": "然后整体学完之后呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0127",
      "start": 207.73,
      "end": 210.06,
      "text": "再去零零散散的去补充一些细节"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0128",
      "start": 210.06,
      "end": 211.9,
      "text": "比如说翻越的概念"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0129",
      "start": 212.03,
      "end": 213.36,
      "text": "画通道线的概念"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0130",
      "start": 213.5,
      "end": 215.36,
      "text": "正统的顶和底的概念"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0131",
      "start": 215.36,
      "end": 216.76,
      "text": "其实就是讲真假突破"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0132",
      "start": 217.2,
      "end": 219.33,
      "text": "就是我们之前不是不知道"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0133",
      "start": 219.5,
      "end": 220.4,
      "text": "我这斐波那契"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0134",
      "start": 220.4,
      "end": 221.26,
      "text": "该从哪拉吗"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0135",
      "start": 221.26,
      "end": 223.06,
      "text": "我是用假突破这个点去拉"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0136",
      "start": 223.06,
      "end": 225.3,
      "text": "还是用那个之前第一次突破那个点了"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0137",
      "start": 225.4,
      "end": 226.63,
      "text": "这就是正统的顶和底"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0138",
      "start": 226.93,
      "end": 228.33,
      "text": "我们废话不多说"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0139",
      "start": 228.46,
      "end": 229.56,
      "text": "那么另外呢就是"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0140",
      "start": 229.56,
      "end": 231.66,
      "text": "如果说你是看原著看书的话呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0141",
      "start": 231.76,
      "end": 233.9,
      "text": "我给你讲一下你重点看哪些东西"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0142",
      "start": 234.16,
      "end": 234.9,
      "text": "这是第十版的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0143",
      "start": 234.9,
      "end": 236.8,
      "text": "我手上有一本纸质的第十版"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0144",
      "start": 236.8,
      "end": 237.46,
      "text": "但是呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0145",
      "start": 237.46,
      "end": 240.66,
      "text": "其实这个PDF他写的是最新第十版"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0146",
      "start": 240.66,
      "end": 241.86,
      "text": "跟我手上这本纸质版的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0147",
      "start": 241.86,
      "end": 242.6,
      "text": "还是有点出入"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0148",
      "start": 242.6,
      "end": 243.3,
      "text": "这是PDF的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0149",
      "start": 244.63,
      "end": 245.2,
      "text": "那么这个呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0150",
      "start": 245.2,
      "end": 248.26,
      "text": "是Epub版本的你看他的只有130页"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0151",
      "start": 248.26,
      "end": 249.23,
      "text": "但是正儿八经的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0152",
      "start": 249.23,
      "end": 250.46,
      "text": "我手上这个纸质的版本呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0153",
      "start": 250.46,
      "end": 252.63,
      "text": "其实是有240多页吧好像是"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0154",
      "start": 252.7,
      "end": 255.1,
      "text": "对245页 那这个Epub版本呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0155",
      "start": 255.1,
      "end": 258.0,
      "text": "它只有130页丢了哪些东西呢"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0156",
      "start": 258.3,
      "end": 259.93,
      "text": "丢了一个很重要的东西"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0157",
      "start": 261.53,
      "end": 263.13,
      "text": "或者说买纸质的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0158",
      "start": 263.13,
      "end": 263.76,
      "text": "重点看的话"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0159",
      "start": 263.86,
      "end": 266.4,
      "text": "第二章里边最后有一个"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0160",
      "start": 266.5,
      "end": 269.23,
      "text": "波浪规则和指南的总结"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0161",
      "start": 269.23,
      "end": 270.03,
      "text": "看见了吗"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0162",
      "start": 270.06,
      "end": 271.63,
      "text": "你像他这个翻译的就有问题"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0163",
      "start": 271.63,
      "end": 272.66,
      "text": "我们上节课规定了"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0164",
      "start": 272.8,
      "end": 274.73,
      "text": "八浪一循环我们分为驱动浪和"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0165",
      "start": 274.83,
      "end": 276.36,
      "text": "和这个调整浪是吧"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0166",
      "start": 276.5,
      "end": 278.76,
      "text": "然后驱动浪里边包括了推动浪"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0167",
      "start": 278.76,
      "end": 280.26,
      "text": "所以它俩不是一回事"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0168",
      "start": 280.33,
      "end": 282.1,
      "text": "但是你像这个翻译的版本"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0169",
      "start": 282.1,
      "end": 283.73,
      "text": "它就完全的颠倒过来了"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0170",
      "start": 283.73,
      "end": 284.8,
      "text": "它的意思是"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0171",
      "start": 284.96,
      "end": 286.56,
      "text": "推动浪里边包括了驱动浪"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0172",
      "start": 286.56,
      "end": 288.16,
      "text": "给他俩颠倒了一下能理解吗"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0173",
      "start": 288.36,
      "end": 291.0,
      "text": "所以你像这种细节如果说"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0174",
      "start": 291.33,
      "end": 294.06,
      "text": "那你再去看别人的教材也好教程也好"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0175",
      "start": 294.06,
      "end": 294.93,
      "text": "你自己一定要"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0176",
      "start": 295.06,
      "end": 296.73,
      "text": "搞清楚本质的东西是什么"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0177",
      "start": 296.73,
      "end": 298.6,
      "text": "千万不要被这些名字所混淆"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0178",
      "start": 298.6,
      "end": 301.16,
      "text": "这里边这个 我们今天会着重聊"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0179",
      "start": 301.3,
      "end": 301.93,
      "text": "这些内容"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0180",
      "start": 301.93,
      "end": 303.93,
      "text": "那么每一句话我们只要都能听懂"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG_0181",
      "start": 304.03,
      "end": 306.33,
      "text": "那么我们这节课就算完成任务好吧"
    }
  ],
